**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.turbo
.env*

# sst
.sst

# Trim the quest-processor image build context (was ~3 GB → slow/timeout-prone on the
# deploy runner). These dirs aren't needed to build or run the server. NOTE: do not exclude
# whole workspace members — pnpm needs every package.json for lockfile resolution. The
# entries below are VCS metadata, build output, mobile shells, tests, and docs-site (which
# pnpm-workspace.yaml already excludes via `!docs-site`) - all but the two docs-site
# categories re-admitted below.
.git
**/.next
**/.open-next
**/coverage
apps/client/ios
apps/client/android
apps/client/e2e
docs-site
# ...except the two help categories. apps/client's `prebuild` regenerates the help index
# and the bundled markdown from them, and refuses to write an empty index, so an image
# built without these fails loudly instead of shipping a help panel with no content.
# Must stay in sync with INCLUDED_CATEGORIES in packages/scripts/help/loadHelpArticles.ts.
!docs-site/docs/features
!docs-site/docs/admin
.playwright-mcp
